se,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"94627cc9-450a-428e-bf83-86cc7a8df4e1","cid":"direct_message:!members-80ErcEnO3Ivl_mR-TU8N6OHdiU9NNNjVvGLwZAs5H4k","text":"May be bad timing but looks like my company is laying off some people, started today 😬. Fortunately, my team is safe from all the cuts (supposedly 🤞)","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1758055830997,"updatedAt":1758055830997,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"c7b1a736-797b-47e1-8a60-d954e25b6e9c","cid":"direct_message:!members-80ErcEnO3Ivl_mR-TU8N6OHdiU9NNNjVvGLwZAs5H4k","text":"615-491-9759. My email is ngyn.long.3319@gmail.com","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1758055747909,"updatedAt":1758055747909,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"28d76262-ddba-48f1-a70a-1171dbbd2d47","cid":"group_message:GroupMessage-3396660779279434532","text":"Hey Cat! No worries. Sorry i dont know her.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1756552075542,"updatedAt":1756552075542,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"a88791c3-3aff-4db9-981d-10e1f26d2116","cid":"direct_message:!members-Qahc9Qx1Dt8p-NXvT9JYK7-x0ZoS55y7AOXzTL9tMS4","text":"All good man! Have a fun and safe trip with the fam!","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1755798681032,"updatedAt":1755798806294,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"705ee037-1d12-4d03-8690-f40cd1df29b2","cid":"direct_message:!members-Qahc9Qx1Dt8p-NXvT9JYK7-x0ZoS55y7AOXzTL9tMS4","text":"Whats up man? Whats your number? Are you going to cooldown run club tonight?","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1755797683832,"updatedAt":1755797683832,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"d0dfa14a-fe61-4c86-91df-58dd4fa8a412","cid":"direct_message:!members-Qahc9Qx1Dt8p-NXvT9JYK7-x0ZoS55y7AOXzTL9tMS4","text":"Awesome! Feel free to connect with me for the next cooldown run club meetup! 615-491-9759.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1755267874659,"updatedAt":1755278932025,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"37666ba1-e8a8-43df-9100-c97993ee454b","cid":"direct_message:!members-Qahc9Qx1Dt8p-NXvT9JYK7-x0ZoS55y7AOXzTL9tMS4","text":"I know Jake has been talking about an evening one. Let me loop back with him and see where he is with that.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1755267832819,"updatedAt":1755278933818,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"93ec6b46-2191-4f52-b2be-a185b9f4f0b4","cid":"direct_message:!members-Qahc9Qx1Dt8p-NXvT9JYK7-x0ZoS55y7AOXzTL9tMS4","text":"Dude i noticed youre in the way run club and the cooldown run club. I have been meaning to link up with ya at cooldown run club. Let’s definitely run together at the next run club meetup. ","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1755223994468,"updatedAt":1755224037100,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"a85dd716-f015-4b00-bcf4-f56dabb7fa94","cid":"direct_message:!members-tjwsIrjRS8t1i2BAVLR31cmBHKi0JJ1OCV_jwmlLAzk","text":"Bliss and i are going to bringles in the nations to chill and hang if yall wanna join.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1750018541268,"updatedAt":1750018541268,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"ffc996b3-4592-4982-83b1-ed90a873f726","cid":"direct_message:!members-tjwsIrjRS8t1i2BAVLR31cmBHKi0JJ1OCV_jwmlLAzk","text":"I have a 2 year old aussie name Bliss. We usually go walk at mccabe park. Feel free to hit us up whenever yall are free - 615-491-9759.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1749749295250,"updatedAt":1749830049105,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"1cd1fcb2-590f-4a00-b379-a8647abb67f9","cid":"direct_message:!members-tjwsIrjRS8t1i2BAVLR31cmBHKi0JJ1OCV_jwmlLAzk","text":"Hey! Good running with you tonight! If you ever wanna walk the dogs together, let me know. Im trying to get my dog to meet other dogs more with the warmer weather. ","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1749691352765,"updatedAt":1749691352765,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"6d61fd00-a049-4c21-bf88-e43cb93a6869","cid":"direct_message:!members-99MHOA10plVWnKa59YOqaQUySUeR6UmnyLP_aPGGALA","text":"No worries! And im sorry to hear about your injuries. I hope its healing quickly! I run with the nations run club every monday at 6:30pm at southern grist. Feel free to reach out if you can make it - 615-491-9759.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1746925001803,"updatedAt":1746925001803,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"00c58686-78a6-43df-95e8-bc58917f2cd9","cid":"direct_message:!members-pQZolItItcCHNZjPbUNSbSd_-q1dPaumkXnXLhHZ9nw","text":"Hey were you at 12 south run club last night? I thought i saw ya!","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1746545978900,"updatedAt":1746545978900,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"00af99ec-16a7-4cbf-aef1-a7fa9689e7fb","cid":"direct_message:!members-pQZolItItcCHNZjPbUNSbSd_-q1dPaumkXnXLhHZ9nw","text":"Hey thanks for the add. Good running with ya on wednesday evening. Apparently you showed up in my pace group that night haha.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1745003004058,"updatedAt":1767719224020,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"a06f90a8-f4b2-405b-9aae-7349f06dd9fc","cid":"direct_message:!members-99MHOA10plVWnKa59YOqaQUySUeR6UmnyLP_aPGGALA","text":"Hey good morning! Are you running the nashville rock n roll? ","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1744632257780,"updatedAt":1744632257780,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"0029118b-d9fc-4f5c-9d8d-1cadcca41051","cid":"direct_message:!members-OjEY7kqMfnjvdKQKl4T1cIlxYCRmjxo3oG-W82AIbig","text":"Hope you’re doing well!","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1744120511168,"updatedAt":1744120511168,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"ad997926-115a-44bd-a8a7-67f2f70b8363","cid":"direct_message:!members-OjEY7kqMfnjvdKQKl4T1cIlxYCRmjxo3oG-W82AIbig","text":"We ran together at 12 south yesterday and i didnt see ya?!  How did that happened?! 😅","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1744120500906,"updatedAt":1744120500906,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"c8d17b78-e478-4681-814d-ec258274751c","cid":"direct_message:!members-Q4htjOM_1C5xQ26_F6267XsEpOABUmMM39uABG9RHeg","text":"Okay so i might have talked it up too much! Only got 13 miles in today! Ill do better for your name sake next time! 🤣","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1742760926447,"updatedAt":1742760926447,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"41e757e3-45a2-417d-a9fc-27d52777b6db","cid":"direct_message:!members-Q4htjOM_1C5xQ26_F6267XsEpOABUmMM39uABG9RHeg","text":"Next long run will be 17 miles! Hahaha","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1742430723803,"updatedAt":1742435578894,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"22aec461-861d-4e82-9245-0086cd75f35a","cid":"direct_message:!members-Q4htjOM_1C5xQ26_F6267XsEpOABUmMM39uABG9RHeg","text":"I was so inspired by your 17 miles that i ran a long one (9 miles) today 😅🤣","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1742429202534,"updatedAt":1742429202534,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"4b0f88f4-6fd3-4fee-8c8a-271fba0bb625","cid":"direct_message:!members-Q4htjOM_1C5xQ26_F6267XsEpOABUmMM39uABG9RHeg","text":"Hope you’re doing well! And crushing it with your training!!!","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1742345228844,"updatedAt":1742345228844,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"e3634aa3-ef66-4bb9-992b-a9d8847f7e00","cid":"direct_message:!members-Q4htjOM_1C5xQ26_F6267XsEpOABUmMM39uABG9RHeg","text":"Darn!!! Well if i dont win and get a medal from this tourney, i will guilt trip you for the rest of your life! If i win, well…","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1742345202867,"updatedAt":1742345202867,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned"